        <body>
            <div xml:id="d288-a2">

                <pb facs="0814" n="600" xml:id="pg600"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 1.</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>His excellency Jusaumi Sawa Nohuyoshi to Mr. De Long</head>
                <p>
                    <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokie</hi></placeName>,7<hi
                        rendition="#italic">th month,</hi> 14<hi rendition="#italic">th day,</hi>
                        4<hi rendition="#italic">th year Miji.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency:</hi> I have the honor to advise you
                    that I have been removed from the office of guiamssshio, (minister for foreign
                    affairs,) and Mr. Ewackura has been appointed in my place as my successor in
                    that office. I beg to tender you my most sincere thanks for your courteous and
                    friendly consideration for me hitherto, while I occupied that position.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c., &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JUSAUMI SAWA NOBUYOSHI.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
